  "request": "JBH-74 section 5: remove modules jbh-notification and jbh-commons-lib from the root pom.xml and delete both folders. Finance and preferences modules now use com.jbh:jbh-commons-lib:1.0.0-SNAPSHOT as an external package (add https://maven.pkg.github.com/kkpa-jbh/jbh-commons-lib to the github profile; one entry in dependencyManagement). Remove jbh-notification-infra from jbh-z-assembly/pom.xml and the 'Notification module' index-dependency block from jbh-z-assembly application.properties. Delete .github/workflows/publish-contracts.yml. Remove distributionManagement if nothing deploys a package anymore. Remove leftovers (module-info, *.mk, docs). The app still starts on port 7777. Ticket: JBH-74 (naming only; do NOT move it in Linear \u2014 jbh-leader owns the status). Stop after the proposal is committed and the Step 3a briefing is shown; do not dispatch Step 5 until jbh-leader sends \"go section 5\".",
